WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.320
The Young Girl stood silently&nbsp;
in a room full of corpses,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:11.040
staring off into the distance. She was in&nbsp;
a trance, seemingly unaware of the carnage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:16.080
that’d just unfolded around her. Some of&nbsp;
the men were shot or stabbed or beaten,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:23.200
others had no apparent cause of death whatsoever.&nbsp;
But the Young Girl was unscathed. She was wearing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:27.840
a yellow summer dress and looked like she&nbsp;
couldn’t have been more than three years old.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.360
She awoke from her trance, still paying no&nbsp;
heed to the violence in the room, and left.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.360
This is the story of SCP - 053,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:44.320
the Young Girl. Her strange and terrifying&nbsp;
life before containment, her thrilling capture,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:51.520
and the part she played in one of the most&nbsp;
dangerous SCP Foundation cross-tests of all time.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:58.080
She had no name. The Young Girl could never&nbsp;
spend enough time around someone to be given one.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:03.360
It was her terrible curse that she could&nbsp;
never stay in one place for too long,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:08.960
or something truly awful would happen to everyone&nbsp;
around her. She’d been drifting for years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:16.160
but never grew to look older than a child. Her&nbsp;
memories were long but formless - divided mostly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:21.920
into ten-minute increments. The Young Girl&nbsp;
kept on moving. It was all she could do.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:27.920
In 1993, when the Young Girl had already&nbsp;
been alive for a very long time, she found&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:33.360
herself in Illinois after days of trekking on the&nbsp;
roadside. She would scavenge what little food she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:38.880
needed from the trash, and drink from lakes,&nbsp;
rivers, or even puddles when she needed to.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:45.280
Deep down, the Young Girl knew that even if&nbsp;
she grew hungry or thirsty, she would not die.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:50.640
In her travels, the Young Girl had managed&nbsp;
to scrounge together a few dollars,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:54.240
and though she knew her contact&nbsp;
with people had to be limited,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.240 --> 00:02:00.560
there was one thing she wanted that felt worth&nbsp;
the risk: A candy bar. It’d been a long time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:06.320
since she tasted chocolate, and she found the&nbsp;
idea of tasting it again too enticing to resist.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:11.280
When she reached Chicago, she entered a small&nbsp;
corner store with her handful of dollars,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:16.160
selected a candy bar from the rack, and&nbsp;
approached the counter. For reasons even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:21.040
she didn’t fully understand, she kept her eyes&nbsp;
down as she placed the money on the counter.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:27.760
You see, SCP - 053 was always a special&nbsp;
child. As we briefly mentioned earlier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:32.640
you might even say she was cursed. Whenever&nbsp;
she was around other people for too long,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:39.520
terrible things tended to happen. Unspeakable&nbsp;
things. And as a component of this strange,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:44.000
unexplainable curse - or perhaps as a&nbsp;
means of keeping her safe from it - the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:49.200
Young Girl was doomed to never understand&nbsp;
the nature of her predicament. It was like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:53.760
there was a mental wall between her and&nbsp;
the horrors her presence could cause.

00:02:54.640 --> 00:03:00.000
All she knew was that it was best to avoid eye&nbsp;
contact, stay away from large groups of people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:07.840
at all costs, and never spend any longer than&nbsp;
ten minutes around anyone. Ever. That’s why,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:13.200
as she waited for her chocolate bar at the cash&nbsp;
register, she kept her head down and waited to go.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:18.640
The cashier looked down upon this strange girl&nbsp;
with apparent concern. It’d been a slow day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:23.360
all in all. A few listless patrons milled&nbsp;
around the store, window shopping. His&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:30.080
brain was practically on autopilot, until he saw&nbsp;
this child. She looked filthy, in a dishevelled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:36.480
dress and was totally alone. What on earth had&nbsp;
happened to this child? The more he looked at her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:42.800
the more he sensed a creepy vibe exuding from&nbsp;
her. Something about this girl was wrong.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:49.120
He spoke softly to her, introducing himself&nbsp;
as Miles, and asking her where her mommy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:54.640
and daddy were. The Young Girl hesitated for&nbsp;
just a few seconds too long for his liking,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:59.200
before simply saying that they were at home.&nbsp;
Any parent who’d let their three-year-old kid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:03.200
just wander around the South Side&nbsp;
of Chicago alone was either crazy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:09.120
neglectful, or both. He asked her politely&nbsp;
to remain in the store, while he gave the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:14.320
police a quick call. He’d even let her have&nbsp;
the candy bar for free while she waited.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:19.440
Immediately, the little girl became uncomfortable.&nbsp;
She’d already been in here for a few minutes now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:24.880
and while Miles called the police he expected&nbsp;
her to wait around even longer. Again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:29.440
she couldn’t even tell you why she knew&nbsp;
waiting around like this would be so dangerous,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:35.600
but she had a nagging, instinctual awareness&nbsp;
that she needed to get out. Around the store,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:42.240
the few patrons still inside started to get a&nbsp;
strange feeling, like someone was watching them.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:46.480
Soon, what seemed like mild paranoia&nbsp;
was quickly becoming white-hot anger.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:53.280
Pure rage. They felt almost like they&nbsp;
had to kill someone. But not just anyone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:59.040
Someone particular. They&nbsp;
had to kill the little girl.

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:04.480
It wasn’t long until the police arrived. Two&nbsp;
officers, Holiday and DeWitt, entered to collect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:10.000
the apparently neglected little girl. It was&nbsp;
a story they’d sadly heard all too often - a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:14.720
tragically common occurrence in the big city.&nbsp;
When the two of them approached the Young Girl,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:19.840
she was looking down at the ground. They tried&nbsp;
to speak to her but she was unresponsive. Miles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:24.560
looked on, concerned, but deep down,&nbsp;
he felt the same bizarre progression&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:32.560
all the other store-goers were feeling: Confusion,&nbsp;
irritability, and finally... violent rage.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:38.240
The corner store was a powder keg,&nbsp;
all it needed now was a spark.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:42.960
And that spark came when Officer Holiday reached&nbsp;
down, and took the Young Girl by the arm.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:50.640
His bare skin touched her’s, and it was all over.&nbsp;
The cop twitched, his mind washed out in murderous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:56.720
insanity, as he reached for his side-arm. Officer&nbsp;
DeWitt opened his mouth to protest, but he didn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.720 --> 00:06:02.400
manage to get a syllable out before Holiday turned&nbsp;
and shot him. In a fraction of a second, the quiet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:08.240
corner store exploded into a violent bloodbath,&nbsp;
as the patrons and cops slaughtered each other.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:11.520
All the while, the Young Girl&nbsp;
just stood there in a trance.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:18.320
Everyone was dead within minutes, except Miles&nbsp;
and the Young Girl. He shakily rose to his feet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:23.520
his mind carved out by madness, and reached&nbsp;
for Officer Holiday’s discarded pistol.

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:29.360
Outside of the store, The Young Girl appeared,&nbsp;
walking out as if nothing had happened.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.120
Inside, Miles’s body was&nbsp;
sprawled over the counter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:36.880
clutching his chest as if&nbsp;
his heart had just exploded.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:43.040
This was the true nature of the Young Girl’s&nbsp;
curse. Anyone who meets her eye, touches her skin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:47.760
or spends over ten minutes around her is&nbsp;
destined to slip into a state of murderous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:54.720
insanity. They’ll go into a kill-crazy frenzy,&nbsp;
and attack anyone around them, until all that’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.720 --> 00:07:00.640
left is them and the Young Girl. At which point,&nbsp;
they’ll try to kill her, too - but the mere act of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:06.800
attempting to kill her is also fatal, killing its&nbsp;
victims with a massive heart attack or a seizure.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:12.480
The second part of the girl’s curse&nbsp;
is that she herself can never die.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:17.520
She keeps coming back, unknowingly causing&nbsp;
more misery and death along the way.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:23.440
Until, of course, a certain&nbsp;
secret organization took notice.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:28.880
That night, the Young Girl sat in the cavernous&nbsp;
interior of a local abandoned warehouse,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:34.080
quietly eating her hard-earned candy bar.&nbsp;
Suddenly, she heard a quiet “crack” in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:39.440
distance. She tried to move her left arm, but&nbsp;
found it was numb. She could barely move it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:44.480
The Girl turned her head, and saw a tranquilizer&nbsp;
dart sticking out of her skin. Instinctively,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:49.760
she got up and began to run, limping as her&nbsp;
left leg started to lose all feeling too.

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:54.560
Suddenly, she was surrounded by footsteps,&nbsp;
as masked men in SWAT uniforms emerged out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.560 --> 00:08:00.240
of the darkness on all sides. The last thing she&nbsp;
remembered before slipping out of consciousness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:06.240
was a blindfold being pulled over her eyes, and&nbsp;
tiny metal handcuffs clasping over her wrists.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:13.440
When she woke up, she was in the nicest room she’d&nbsp;
slept in in years. It was sixteen feet by sixteen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:19.520
feet, with toys, books, and games. Standing&nbsp;
across the room from her was a stranger in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:25.600
a full hazmat suit, connected to a long, steel&nbsp;
cable leading out of the room. He spoke calmly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:31.040
and politely. A timer on his wrist counted down&nbsp;
from ten minutes. The stranger explained to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:35.280
Young Girl that they would be taking care of&nbsp;
her now, and would provide her with all the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:42.400
toys and games and treats she wanted, provided she&nbsp;
cooperated and submitted willingly to some tests.

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:46.640
Compared to living out on the&nbsp;
streets with no food or comfort,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:48.480
this seemed like an excellent compromise.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:55.120
She would live in what seemed like luxury, and&nbsp;
every so often, she’d be taken to a testing room&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.120 --> 00:09:01.520
with a stranger in an orange jumpsuit. After a few&nbsp;
minutes of waiting, the stranger would inevitably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:06.800
go feral, and attempt to kill her - and then&nbsp;
always die in the process. The strangers in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:12.000
hazmat suits told her that all of these tests were&nbsp;
helping them learn extremely valuable things about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:19.200
her, and that soon, they’d have a very special&nbsp;
job for her. It would be a wonderful surprise.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:25.840
It was in the spring of 1994 that the Young&nbsp;
Girl, now officially designated SCP - 053,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:31.920
finally received her special mission. Several&nbsp;
strangers in full hazmat suits, wielding rifles,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:37.280
escorted her out of her usual bedroom. She asked&nbsp;
where she was being taken, and was told she was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:42.480
going to meet a new friend. She was taken&nbsp;
to one of the recreational testing rooms,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:51.200
and pushed inside. Out in front of her, she saw&nbsp;
something terrifying: A giant, reptilian creature.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:55.840
She retreated from it instinctually, hiding&nbsp;
behind a chair in the containment area.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.840 --> 00:10:00.720
The giant reptile didn’t move. It just&nbsp;
sat there. Eventually, she plucked up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:06.480
the courage to go and touch the creature, before&nbsp;
retreating again. No reaction. Little by little,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:11.760
the Young Girl gained confidence, and continued&nbsp;
to approach and pat the creature. It exhaled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:16.640
through its huge nostrils, and the Young Girl&nbsp;
literally jumped for joy in her amusement.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:22.080
She began to play with the docile monster,&nbsp;
hugging it, even drawing on it with a crayon.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:27.040
The observers were truly baffled. What the Young&nbsp;
Girl didn’t know was that she was playing with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:33.760
SCP - 682, one of the most hateful and aggressive&nbsp;
anomalies under the Foundation’s watchful eye.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:39.600
And yet, in her presence, the creature&nbsp;
was like an overgrown puppy dog.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:44.560
After the test phase, the Young Girl was removed&nbsp;
from the Hard-To-Kill Reptile’s presence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:49.440
immediately causing the creature to become&nbsp;
violent and murderous once again. After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:54.640
being separated from her strange new friend, the&nbsp;
Young Girl was seen crying for several minutes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.440 --> 00:11:00.080
According to all accounts, the Young Girl&nbsp;
is eager to see her friend again some day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:04.000
though considering the Reptile killed&nbsp;
several guards after their separation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:06.800
the Foundation isn’t eager to grant her that wish.

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:12.720
SCP-053 was classified as Euclid and&nbsp;
continues to be held in containment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:17.200
with her toys, books, and games&nbsp;
rotated out on a regular basis.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:23.200
Seeing as she shows no sign of aging, this&nbsp;
ongoing containment is likely to be the sad,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:29.280
strange fate of the Young Girl. An anomaly that&nbsp;
never wanted to hurt anyone - but an important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.280 --> 00:11:35.600
and cruel reminder that what we want doesn’t&nbsp;
always influence the world in the way we want.

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:39.680
Check out “SCP - 096 - The Shy Guy”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:47.520
and “SCP - 5000 - The Suit” for more tales from&nbsp;
the SCP Foundation’s deepest, darkest archives.

